  "c4be668d-3aaa-4295-a5fe-619f82c4efc3"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is a measure on vertices \[LongDash] a point known only up to a \
distribution.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"cbad70bf-7b58-407f-9eb4-477e7f9dafcd"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
