Cell[TextData[{
 "In ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraSceneHighlight"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/SyntheticInfrageometry/ref/InfraSceneHighlight", 
    "WolframInstitute/SyntheticInfrageometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "80431ae2-0955-432f-9f9a-c1d193884553"],
 " a mesopoint renders diffusely by ",
 StyleBox["relative",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " mass: each vertex is drawn at its mass over the heaviest mass, so the \
modal vertex is full and lighter ones fade. A uniform mesopoint \[LongDash] a \
ball, for instance \[LongDash] is therefore uniformly bright; its diffuseness \
is its extent, not a per-vertex fade."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"192b1088-9518-468f-97a2-0a81ead0cef7"]
}, Open  ]],

